BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:NT Live: All My Sons
DTSTART:20260623T013000Z
DTEND:20260623T043000Z
DTSTAMP:20260623T013000Z
UID:MabXc3OX5p
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 165 mins (2h45m)\n\nStage to Screen Bryan Cranston 
 and Marianne Jean-Baptiste feature in a hit new production of Arthur Mille
 r's classic play\, from visionary director Ivo Van Hove.But nothing lasts 
 forever and their contented lives\, already shadowed by the loss of their 
 eldest boy to war\, are about to shatter. With the return of a figure from
  the past\, long buried truths are forced to the surface and the price of 
 their American dream is laid bare.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-ev
 ents/stage-to-screen/nt-live-all-my-sons\n\nEstimated start: 18:45
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
