UID:ssJenqx6jm
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 109 mins (1h49m)\n\nIn May 2021\, a U.K. Home Office
  dawn raid triggers one of the most spontaneous and successful acts of civ
 il resistance in recent memory. In Scotland’s most diverse neighborhood\
 , hundreds of residents rush to the streets to stop the deportation of the
 ir neighbors.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/everybody-to-kenm
 ure-street\n\nEstimated start: 17:15
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
