DTEND:20260617T040000Z
DTSTAMP:20260617T020000Z
UID:aSRdqo3inq
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 103 mins (1h43m)\n\nFacing the death of his country
 ’s glaciers and the loss of his beloved grandparents\, Icelandic writer 
 Andri Snær Magnason turns his archives into a time capsule to hold what i
 s slipping away — family\, memory\, time\, and water.\n\nhttps://www.sif
 f.net/cinema/in-theaters/time-and-water\n\nEstimated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
