UID:5NBCoNvtr6
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 122 mins (2h02m)\n\nThe Popcorn ListSeeds is a port
 rait of centennial farmers in the American South. Using lyrical black and 
 white imagery\, this meditative film examines the decline of generational 
 Black farmers and the significance of owning land.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net
 /programs-and-events/the-popcorn-list/seeds\n\nEstimated start: 18:45
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
